  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federation of Somali Trade Unions (FESTU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Somalia. The main outcome areas it contributes to are countering the threats to democracy and human rights, and advancing equality and workers rights to build new alliances and push for progressive politics. The main rights holders are workers/members of FESTU and its affiliated trade union members with a specific focus on women and youth workers. Through social dialogue, workshops/trainings for FESTU&apos;s members and national and international advocacy the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas</narrative>
  </description>
